[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11401.83, "timestamp": "03:10:01", "text": "我先模仿了那個人，然後又模仿了裡面的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11411.19, "timestamp": "03:10:11", "text": "。不知道喵喵"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11413.11, "timestamp": "03:10:13", "text": "睡著了嗎？  這是哪裡？  好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11421.51, "timestamp": "03:10:21", "text": "。  他們好像不認識我似的。  只有少數人認識我。  進來吧，年輕的流浪者。一口下去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11427.269, "timestamp": "03:10:27", "text": "你就明白了，我可沒這本事。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11434.985, "timestamp": "03:10:34", "author": "@sappyissap", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/L44QLCQGMU6SE1bCsql8PIfsFhAkVolvmYx9MCoDWwH4qtCvwblTh0CPSGcixecYRTl8tjPCwbo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "My name means 7 sages and 7 stars and I happen to have 7 personality "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11445.51, "timestamp": "03:10:45", "text": "盔甲。  送禮物。  你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11450.309, "timestamp": "03:10:50", "text": "好吧，這些人不想跟我說話。  [咳] [清喉嚨] 不知道那房子在哪裡。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11452.084, "timestamp": "03:10:52", "author": "@sappyissap", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/L44QLCQGMU6SE1bCsql8PIfsFhAkVolvmYx9MCoDWwH4qtCvwblTh0CPSGcixecYRTl8tjPCwbo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "And the name sapp is the front section "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11458.389, "timestamp": "03:10:58", "text": "好吧，"}]